                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "@bennypowers, setting custom surroundings is now possible with buffer local configuration. More details [here](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/ee1ea2581843b5b2a74a52f6029af3bc4a357f93/doc/mini.txt#L195-L215) and [here](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/ee1ea2581843b5b2a74a52f6029af3bc4a357f93/lua/mini/surround.lua#L266-L275).\r\n\r\nBasically, use any suitable method for creating appropriate buffer variable `vim.b.minisurround_config` for specific filetypes. I prefer using 'after/ftplugin' directory for that, but autocommands can be used too.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/bennypowers/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/bennypowers\">@bennypowers</a>, setting custom surroundings is now possible with buffer local configuration. More details <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/ee1ea2581843b5b2a74a52f6029af3bc4a357f93/doc/mini.txt#L195-L215\">here</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/ee1ea2581843b5b2a74a52f6029af3bc4a357f93/lua/mini/surround.lua#L266-L275\">here</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Basically, use any suitable method for creating appropriate buffer variable <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.b.minisurround_config</code> for specific filetypes. I prefer using 'after/ftplugin' directory for that, but autocommands can be used too.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "@bennypowers, setting custom surroundings is now possible with buffer local configuration. More details here and here.\nBasically, use any suitable method for creating appropriate buffer variable vim.b.minisurround_config for specific filetypes. I prefer using 'after/ftplugin' directory for that, but autocommands can be used too.",
